# T2 — Canonical root data.json + allowlisted web figure staging

## Deliverables
- `data.json` (root) — single source of truth, 467→ restructured with ALL page data
- `assets/figures/*.png` — 12 web-staged figure copies (allowlist-only, no figures/*.csv shipped)

## Acceptance criteria (all PASS)
- `.venv/bin/python -c "import json;d=json.load(open('data.json'));assert d['summary']['n']==2652"` ✓
- `.venv/bin/python tools/verify_restraint.py --check-datajson data.json` → OK (restraint fields match AUTHORITATIVE) ✓
- All 12 `data.json` figure `file` paths exist under `assets/figures/` ✓

## Structure
- `summary`: n, readmitted, readmission_rate, age_mean/range, ace, restraint (AUTHORITATIVE: n=510, rate_restrained=13.5%, not_restrained=2142), diagnosis_records, icd_codes, dsm5_categories, best_oof_auc
- `pipeline`: 5 steps (verbatim from baseline)
- `findings`: cohort_rate, demo_max, groups (age 8-band, gender 2, cssrs 2, insurance 2 + note, restraint 2 AUTHORITATIVE), groupStats (gender/cssrs/insurance/restraint OR/CI/p — restraint = 1.52/1.06-2.18/.022)
- `spectrum`: 17 DSM-5 categories (rate/n/readmitted), dx_max, prose_note (DMDD 14.2%)
- `models`: forest (6 predictors — restraint AUTHORITATIVE 1.52[1.06-2.18] p=0.022), auc (3 models × apparent/corrected/oof), optimism_delta (0.047/0.169/0.263), clinical_read
- `equity`: fairness (4 pairings), subgroups (12 with 3 AUCs each)
- `figures`: 12 entries with id/title/tag/file (file → assets/figures/)
- `abstract`: title, byline, sections (Objectives/Methods/Conclusions), results (6 chips — restraint chip = "OR 1.52, p = 0.022"), objectives (4)

## Restraint reconciliation applied
- findings.groups.restraint: [{n:510, readmitted:69, rate:13.5}, {n:2142, readmitted:177, rate:8.3}]
- findings.groupStats.restraint: {or:"1.52", ci:"1.06–2.18", p:".022"}
- models.forest[1]: {label:"Physical restraint use", or:1.52, lo:1.06, hi:2.18, p:0.022}
- abstract.results[1]: "Physical restraint use — OR 1.52, p = 0.022; also the largest driver of length of stay"
- equity.subgroups[10]: "With Restraints" n=510, readmit_rate=13.5%
- equity.subgroups[11]: "Without Restraints" n=2142, readmit_rate=8.3%

